# r1111: reruns of the SQ-HH Machines batch faults on fresh spots (z 260 to 300 band), boot 3 of hhm.
pace 1

## SQ-HH-209 | jug full of water refuses lava (rerun, lava on a fresh block)
> forceload add 0 256 319 319
> pbot spawn hb1 8 -60 290 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
sleep 3
> clear hb1
> setblock 16 -60 300 minecraft:water
> tp hb1 16.5 -59 300.5 0 90
> pbot hold hb1 hearthandharvest:jug
> zq useitem hb1
> setblock 20 -60 300 minecraft:lava
> tp hb1 20.5 -59 300.5 0 90
> zq useitem hb1
> data get entity hb1 SelectedItem.tag.HHJugFluid.Amount
> execute if block 20 -60 300 minecraft:lava
look second useitem FAIL; Amount 1000; lava Test passed

