## SQ-HH-212 | sneak-use picks up a placed 1000 mB jug (rerun, setup written out)
> clear hb1
> setblock 64 -60 296 minecraft:water
> tp hb1 64.5 -59 296.5 0 90
> pbot hold hb1 hearthandharvest:jug
> zq useitem hb1
> setblock 64 -60 296 minecraft:air
> tp hb1 62.5 -59 300.5
> pbot use hb1 64 -61 300 up
> data get block 64 -60 300
> item replace entity hb1 weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air
> zhh2 sneak hb1 true
> pbot use hb1 64 -60 300 up
> zhh2 sneak hb1 false
> data get entity hb1 Inventory
> execute if block 64 -60 300 minecraft:air
look use SUCCESS or CONSUME; Inventory has hearthandharvest:jug with HHJugFluid Amount 1000; block gone

