## SQ-HH-233 | trough extract, sneak extract, drops (rerun, hand emptied before the sneak use)
> clear hb1
> setblock 112 -60 296 hearthandharvest:trough
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:wheat 8
> pbot use hb1 112 -60 296 up
> item replace entity hb1 weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air
> pbot use hb1 112 -60 296 up
> data get block 112 -60 296 Items
> item replace entity hb1 weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air
> zhh2 sneak hb1 true
> pbot use hb1 112 -60 296 up
> zhh2 sneak hb1 false
> data get block 112 -60 296 Items
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:wheat 8
> pbot use hb1 112 -60 296 up
> setblock 112 -60 296 air destroy
