## SQ-HH-252 | sneak pick-up keeps contents (rerun, egg put in slot 4 first)
> clear hb1
> setblock 48 -60 296 hearthandharvest:crate[type=bottom,facing=north]
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:egg
> zhh2 useat hb1 48 -60 296 up 0.47 0.3 0.47
> item replace entity hb1 weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air
> zhh2 sneak hb1 true
> zhh2 useat hb1 48 -60 296 up 0.5 0.3 0.5
> zhh2 sneak hb1 false
> data get entity hb1 Inventory
> execute if block 48 -60 296 minecraft:air
look Test passed; Inventory has a crate with BlockEntityTag holding the egg

